{"name":"The Ninefold Key","slug":"glyph-ninefold-key","blurb":"On the trit street, Golda carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Ninefold. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Ninefold Key.","seal":"1dd14945893f9595e6de62ab59132e9c65ff1fbb0658cfd32239c04bbc8aa032"}
